     "text": "```json\n{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"With apiToken:authenticate, configSecret:credentialAccess, memoryDump:credentialAccess and sshKey:credentialAccess blocked, several steps lose all their routes. ssoLogin:authenticate (AND) needs configSecret, so it fails. vpnSession:authenticate (AND) and dbLogin:authenticate (AND) both need sshKey, so they fail. rdpLogin:authenticate (AND) needs memoryDump, so it fails. As a result, appServer:lateralMovement has no parent left (memoryDump, apiToken and ssoLogin are all unavailable). jumpHost:lateralMovement fails because dbLogin and configSecret are out. fileServer:lateralMovement fails because dbLogin and rdpLogin are out. hypervisor:privilegeEscalation, printServer:lateralMovement, localAdmin:privilegeEscalation, secretsManager:privilegeEscalation and serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation then all fail too. That leaves every parent of crownData:exfiltrate unreachable: vaultRead:collection, codeRepo:collection, shareMount:collection and dbReplica:collection. The target therefore cannot be reached.\"}\n```"
    }
   ],
